tion)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">of</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\"> value</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> }</span></span></code></pre>",
